          <tags>persp.editorOnboardingImageUri:file:/C:/Users/omyhr/AppData/Local/Temp/onboarding_scaled11053297479692868642.png</tags>
          <tags>persp.editorOnboardingText:
This is a Simula System created by the Open Source Project 'Portable Simula Revisited'.
The project was initiated as a response to the lecture held by James Gosling at the 50th
anniversary of Simula at Ifi, University of Oslo (UiO) on 27th September, 2017.

Simula source files should, by convention, end with .sim

		&#x2022; Drop files here to open them
		&#x2022; Menu: File -> Open File - to open files
		&#x2022; Menu: File -> New - to create a new file
		&#x2022; Press Ctrl+N to create a new file
</tags>
